  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - Contribution to World Bank/IFC Trust Funds.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - Contribution to World Bank/IFC Trust Funds. is a component of Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - Support to World Bank/International Finance Corporation technical assistance to expand access to Micro, Small and Medium Sized Enterprise (MSMEs) finance in Middle East and North Africa (MENA). reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;6,812,000. This project benefits Middle East, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Education/training in banking and financial services, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
